# Repository tracking policy. The previous, annotated version of this file is in git
# history and its reasoning in _archive/harness-3.2.0/decisions/accepted/ADR-0022.md.

# --- OS and editor droppings -------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- Commit-message scratch files --------------------------------------------
COMMIT_MSG_*.txt

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
# Separate environment for the human-run market-data download tool (tech plan §15.4).
.venv-download/

# CP7 React SPA: reproducible sources and lockfiles are tracked; installed/build
# outputs and browser-test scratch artifacts stay local.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local CP7 PostgreSQL development cluster, sockets and logs; never source artifacts.
.local/

# --- Market-data payloads (PD-0027 / PD-0028: internal use only) --------------
# Downloaded payload files and quarantine reports stay local and are never committed:
# committing vendor data to history risks redistribution (PRD §4.3). The source registry,
# release files and verification records under data/marketdata/ ARE committed (tech plan §15.3).
data/marketdata/files/
data/marketdata/quarantine/
# Payloads kept as evidence outside the store (e.g. the byte-identical OpenFIGI duplicate moved out
# 2026-10-24) are vendor data too.
data/marketdata/observations/
# The HG2 real-slice evidence pack is computed from those payloads (real closes and rates), so it
# stays local too. The synthetic pack beside it holds no market data and is committed.
reviews/gates/HG2_EVIDENCE/real_slice/
# CP7 raw vendor responses captured as evidence (SEC, OpenFIGI): payloads, so local only.
reviews/CP7_E2_SEC_EVIDENCE/actual/attempt-01.success.body
reviews/CP7_E2_SEC_EVIDENCE/actual/attempt-02.success.body
reviews/CP7_E2_SEC_EVIDENCE/actual/attempt-03.success.body
reviews/CP7_E_EVIDENCE/source-qualification/identity-attempt-1-response.bin

